      "title": "Luther",
      "desc": "Detective John Luther often bends the law to catch criminals, which often endangers his superiors.An uncompromising policeman returns to work after a long leave, on which he was sent due to the trauma he experienced during one of the operations.The first investigation he undertakes concerns the murder of the parents of the brilliant Alice Morgan.A policeman and the victims' daughter begin to form a unique bond.At the same time, John must deal with personal problems.He wants to repair his marriage with Zoe, which has suffered greatly because of his work\nLuther is concerned when he learns that Henry Madsen has awakened from his coma.The policeman is connected with the serial killer by traumatic experiences from months ago.Meanwhile, Luther must focus on the investigation assigned to him.It concerns the murders of four young women.The victims died in four different areas of London.Despite monitoring and a huge number of witnesses, it is impossible to determine the exact course of events.The detective is convinced that he will strike again that same night.At the same time, Luther has a serious conversation with Alice.",
